{
  "uid": "nexuscommerce-capacity",
  "title": "NexusCommerce \u2014 Capacity & Concurrent Users",
  "description": "How many concurrent users the system handles before performance degrades (k6 step load tests)",
  "tags": [
    "nexuscommerce",
    "capacity",
    "load-test"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "System Overview",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "url": "/d/nexuscommerce-overview/nexuscommerce-system-overview"
    },
    {
      "title": "Live (1 s)",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "bolt",
      "url": "/d/nexuscommerce-live/nexuscommerce-live"
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "testid",
        "label": "Test run",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(k6_vus, testid)",
          "refId": "testid"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(k6_vus, testid)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 2,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "slo_latency_ms",
        "label": "Latency limit p95 (ms)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "500",
        "current": {
          "text": "500",
          "value": "500"
        },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "slo_error_pct",
        "label": "Error limit (%)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "1",
        "current": {
          "text": "1",
          "value": "1"
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### How many concurrent users can NexusCommerce handle?\n**Capacity = the highest number of concurrent users at which p95 latency stays \u2264 `$slo_latency_ms` ms and errors stay \u2264 `$slo_error_pct` %** (change both limits at the top). It is measured with a step load test \u2014 run `./loadtest/run.sh`; each virtual user browses the shop like a real customer (catalog, policies, inventory, orders, 1\u20133 s think time). Pick the run in **Test run** and make sure the time range covers it. Throughput that stops growing while latency climbs = the system is saturated."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Capacity verdict \u2014 selected test run",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 3,
      "title": "\u2705 Max concurrent users WITHOUT degradation",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "description": "Highest user level held while p95 latency and error rate stayed within the limits",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "text": "No test in range",
                  "color": "text"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "custom": {}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "text": {
          "valueSize": 64
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max_over_time(((((min_over_time(max(k6_vus{testid=~\"$testid\"})[30s:5s]) == on() max_over_time(max(k6_vus{testid=~\"$testid\"})[30s:5s])) > 0) < scalar((min_over_time((((min_over_time(max(k6_vus{testid=~\"$testid\"})[30s:5s]) == on() max_over_time(max(k6_vus{testid=~\"$testid\"})[30s:5s])) > 0) and on() (((histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(k6_http_req_duration_seconds{testid=~\"$testid\"}[30s])))) > $slo_latency_ms / 1000) or on() ((100 * (sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total{testid=~\"$testid\",expected_response=\"false\"}[30s])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total{testid=~\"$testid\"}[30s]))) > $slo_error_pct)))[$__range:5s] @ end()) or vector(1e12)))) and on() ((histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(k6_http_req_duration_seconds{testid=~\"$testid\"}[30s])))) <= $slo_latency_ms / 1000) and on() ((100 * (sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total{testid=~\"$testid\",expected_response=\"false\"}[30s])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total{testid=~\"$testid\"}[30s]))) <= $slo_error_pct))[$__range:5s] @ end())",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
